---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service & Usage Agreement"
  description="Terms and conditions governing the access and use of CryptoPulse digital media properties, content syndication, and API guidelines."
  canonicalUrl="https://cryptopulse.news/terms"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-20">
    <header class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-slate-800">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-3">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Effective Date: September 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
      <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or utilizing CryptoPulse website, RSS feeds, or media assets, you agree to be bound by these terms. If you disagree with any portion of these provisions, you must cease site access immediately.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white">2. Intellectual Property & Syndication Rights</h2>
        <p>All original reporting, technical graphics, analytical charts, and layout elements are the exclusive intellectual property of CryptoPulse. Brief excerpts with direct clickable attribution links to the canonical source URL are permitted under Fair Use doctrine.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-800 p-6 rounded-xl space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-white">3. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>In no event shall CryptoPulse, its parent entity, journalists, or contributors be held liable for any trading losses, liquidity depletion, smart contract failures, or capital impairment arising from content published on the site.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>